{#
   Args for session-pages.canvas.md.xml.jinja — one block per class session.

   Rules:
     - No date literals. Every Date/Day comes from global_args (SNN_DATE /
       SNN_DAY), so rolling the course to a new semester is one file edit.
     - Title values are YAML, and the `===` block is parsed as YAML: a value
       containing a colon MUST be quoted, or the parse fails.
     - Write `&amp;` for an ampersand. Titles land in an XML attribute.
     - Publish: "true" only when the student page is actually written. A
       session with no page still gets an entry (dates, due items, module
       placement); it just deploys unpublished until the prose exists.
     - Deck / Page paths resolve relative to canvas_material/lectures/.
       Materials paths of Type=file resolve there too, hence ../resources/.
#}

